DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T120000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Internal TestFlight readiness sprint
DESCRIPTION:Run typecheck and tests. Set Sentry DSN. Add PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy to Xcode. Create App Store Connect record.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260515-upload@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T150000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Archive and upload build
DESCRIPTION:Xcode archive succeeds. Build appears in App Store Connect. Internal testing enabled.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260515-phone@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260515T163000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Download on phone
DESCRIPTION:Install from TestFlight on Melanie's iPhone. Complete onboarding and one first consult.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260516-deviceqa@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T130000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Device QA day
DESCRIPTION:Check first-run, settings, share, saved looks, map, themes, VoiceOver, offline cache, and analytics opt-out on a real device.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260517-fixes@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260517T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260517T130000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Launch-blocker fix window
DESCRIPTION:Fix only P0/P1 issues from device QA. Upload a new build only if needed.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260518-assets@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260518T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260518T120000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - External beta prep
DESCRIPTION:Capture screenshots. Finalize subtitle and keywords. Set beta feedback email.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260519-submit@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260519T113000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - External TestFlight submission
DESCRIPTION:Submit build for beta review if internal QA is clean.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260520-beta@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260520
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260524
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - External beta observation
DESCRIPTION:Invite 5-20 trusted testers. Check Sentry daily. Triage feedback into blocker or later.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260524-decision@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T120000
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Public launch decision
DESCRIPTION:Go or no-go based on crash-free sessions, first-consult reliability, and feedback severity.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:outfit-oracle-launch-20260525-release-window@outfitoracle
DTSTAMP:20260515T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260525
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260530
SUMMARY:Outfit Oracle - Public release window
DESCRIPTION:Submit for public App Store release or upload one final beta build based on the launch decision.
